métricas agregadas
Puedes sacar eficiencia por cluster:

SELECT
    CLUSTER_NUMBER,
    SUM(EXECUTION_SECONDS) AS EXEC_TIME,
    SUM(IDLE_AFTER_EXECUTION) AS IDLE_TIME,
    SUM(EXECUTION_SECONDS) 
      / NULLIF(SUM(EXECUTION_SECONDS) + SUM(IDLE_AFTER_EXECUTION),0)
      AS UTILIZATION_RATIO
FROM cluster_lifecycle
GROUP BY CLUSTER_NUMBER;
